    "sub_name": "數學分析(一)實習",
    "sub_ename": "MATHEMATICAL ANALYSIS (1) PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "引導學生計算習題,內容包含多重積分、柱面與球面座標、三重積分之柱面與球面座標、多重積分之變數轉換、向量場、第一線積分、第二線積分、曲面積分。",
    "describe_eh": "Guide students to pratice excercises. Content include multiple integrals, cylindrical and spherical coordinates, triple integrals in cylindrical and spherical coordinates, change of variables in multiple integrals.",
    "pre_subname": "MATH1001微積分(一)、MATH1002微積分(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "MATH1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "MATH1001 CALCULUS(1)、MATH1002 CALCULUS(2)",
